end": 960.56, "text": "Just reminded me of my dad, anyway."}, {"start": 960.56, "end": 964.04, "text": "- Ah, little make out 101, less dad talk,"}, {"start": 964.04, "end": 966.84, "text": "and you could ease up on the bubblegum look class."}, {"start": 966.84, "end": 968.24, "text": "- Oh, no, I really--"}, {"start": 968.24, "end": 969.4, "text": "- No, you!"}, {"start": 973.32, "end": 976.52, "text": "Pizza time! Give me this, you godless hippie-skake!"}, {"start": 976.52, "end": 980.32, "text": "You're sick, sad, twisted old man, and I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 980.32, "end": 982.32, "text": "Yeah, I'm lost."}, {"start": 984.32, "end": 986.32, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 991.32, "end": 994.32, "text": "I gotta say, I hope this is the real one, because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 999.32, "end": 1000.96, "text": "- Ah, okay."}, {"start": 1000.96, "end": 1004.32, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1004.32, "end": 1005.32, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating"}, {"start": 1005.32, "end": 1006.32, "text": "six different timelines."}, {"start": 1006.32, "end": 1008.32, "text": "- Of course I am, my bad."}, {"start": 1013.32, "end": 1015.32, "text": "- I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1015.32, "end": 1017.32, "text": "KSR already dominates enough for our lives."}, {"start": 1017.32, "end": 1020.32, "text": "The universe is an endless raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1020.32, "end": 1022.32, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it but to weather it together."}, {"start": 1022.32, "end": 1024.32, "text": "On the raft of life, a raft held together"}, {"start": 1024.32, "end": 1026.32, "text": "by those few rare, beautiful things"}, {"start": 1026.32, "end": 1028.32, "text": "that we know to be predictable."}, {"start": 1028.32, "end": 1030.32, "text": "- Ropes? - Fine."}, {"start": 1030.32, "end": 1032.32, "text": "- Fine? - Let him finish."}, {"start": 1032.32, "end": 1034.32, "text": "Us."}, {"start": 1034.32, "end": 1036.32, "text": "It won't matter what happens to us as long as we stay honest"}, {"start": 1036.32, "end": 1038.32, "text": "and accepting of each other's flaws and virtues."}, {"start": 1038.32, "end": 1039.32, "text": "Annie will always be driven."}, {"start": 1039.32, "end": 1041.32, "text": "Shirley will always be giving."}, {"start": 1041.32, "end": 1042.32, "text": "Pierce will never apologize."}, {"start": 1042.32, "end": 1044.32, "text": "Britta's sort of a wild card from my perspective."}, {"start": 1044.32, "end": 1046.32, "text": "And Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1046.32, "end": 1049.32, "text": "- Love it! - There are six sides to this die and seven of us."}, {"start": 1049.32, "end": 1052.32, "text": "He devised a system by which he never has to get the pizza."}, {"start": 1052.32, "end": 1053.32, "text": "- Jeff! - Really?"}, {"start": 1053.32, "end": 1055.32, "text": "- Fenty Jackrabs! - Dig, man."}, {"start": 1055.32, "end": 1057.32, "text": "Pretty low, dude."}, {"start": 1057.32, "end": 1060.48, "text": "It's called friendship look it up and car to it. I"}, {"start": 1061.52, "end": 1063.8, "text": "Think we just found our pizza getter. Yeah"}, {"start": 1065.84, "end": 1067.84, "text": "Like it matters who goes"}, {"start": 1074.16, "end": 1078.44, "text": "The toilet and an airplane bathroom airplane bathroom. Oh my pie"}, {"start": 1087.32, "end": 1092.32, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1092.32, "end": 1095.32, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1095.32, "end": 1098.32, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1098.32, "end": 1101.32, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1101.32, "end": 1105.32, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1105.32, "end": 1108.32, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1108.32, "end": 1112.32, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1112.32, "end": 1115.32, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1115.32, "end": 1118.32, "text": "You gotta see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1118.32, "end": 1119.32, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 1119.32, "end": 1123.32, "text": "You're gonna put on the red light."}, {"start": 1123.32, "end": 1126.32, "text": "Rock, set, put on the red light."}, {"start": 1126.32, "end": 1129.32, "text": "Rock, set, put on the red light."}, {"start": 1129.32, "end": 1130.32, "text": "Don't you?"}, {"start": 1130.32, "end": 1133.32, "text": "Rock, set, put on the red light."}, {"start": 1133.32, "end": 1135.32, "text": "Rock, set, put on the red light."}, {"start": 1135.32, "end": 1139.32, "text": "Rock, set, put on the red light."}, {"start": 1139.32, "end": 1140.32, "text": "Two piers."}, {"start": 1140.32, "end": 1142.32, "text": "May he rest in piers."}, {"start": 1142.32, "end": 1144.32, "text": "[LAUGHING]"}, {"start": 1144.32, "end": 1146.42, "text": "Shirley, don't you think you've had enough?"}, {"start": 1146.42, "end": 1147.32, "text": "Of you?"}, {"start": 1147.32, "end": 1148.32, "text": "[gasp]"}, {"start": 1148.32, "end": 1150.32, "text": "Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.32, "end": 1151.32, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1151.32, "end": 1153.32, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.32, "end": 1156.32, "text": "Enough with the timeline, crap, Ahmed!"}, {"start": 1156.32, "end": 1158.32, "text": "Pierce got shot in the leg and died!"}, {"start": 1158.32, "end": 1161.32, "text": "Shirley's a drunk, and he's locked in a mental ward"}, {"start": 1161.32, "end": 1163.32, "text": "because her guilt drove her insane!"}, {"start": 1163.32, "end": 1167.32, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire. Troy lost his larynx"}, {"start": 1167.32, "end": 1171.32, "text": "because for some dumb reason, he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll"}, {"start": 1171.32, "end": 1172.32, "text": "by eating it."}, {"start": 1172.32, "end": 1175.84, "text": "- Eating it, cleaning it on a safe thing about the beat roll."}, {"start": 1175.84, "end": 1179.0, "text": "- Life has gone to hell, Ahmed."}, {"start": 1179.0, "end": 1180.32, "text": "This is real."}, {"start": 1180.32, "end": 1181.96, "text": "Look at us, look at me."}, {"start": 1181.96, "end": 1185.08, "text": "- Greta, you put one wash away blue streak in your hair"}, {"start": 1185.08, "end": 1187.04, "text": "and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1187.04, "end": 1189.2, "text": "- Exactly, life got dark."}, {"start": 1189.2, "end": 1190.4, "text": "- Not because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.4, "end": 1192.6, "text": "- Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.6, "end": 1193.52, "text": "- It's mine."}, {"start": 1193.52, "end": 1195.04, "text": "I've run through that night over and over in my head"}, {"start": 1195.04, "end": 1196.52, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.52, "end": 1199.12, "text": "I should have caught the die and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1199.12, "end": 1201.28, "text": "I failed to do that and we all suffered for it,"}, {"start": 1201.28, "end": 1202.88, "text": "but I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 1205.04, "end": 1205.88, "text": "- What is this?"}, {"start": 1205.88, "end": 1207.68, "text": "- Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest,"}, {"start": 1207.68, "end": 1209.72, "text": "which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.72, "end": 1211.16, "text": "I made us all black OTs out of felt."}, {"start": 1211.16, "end": 1213.68, "text": "I suggest you put 'em on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1215.12, "end": 1217.36, "text": "From now on, I'm evil, Abed."}, {"start": 1217.36, "end": 1218.36, "text": "We are the evil study group,"}, {"start": 1218.36, "end": 1220.48, "text": "and we have but won evil goal."}, {"start": 1220.48, "end": 1222.28, "text": "Returned somehow to the prime timeline,"}, {"start": 1222.28, "end": 1223.92, "text": "the one that I stopped you from rolling that die,"}, {"start": 1223.92, "end": 1225.4, "text": "then we destroy the good versions of ourselves"}, {"start": 1225.4, "end": 1226.88, "text": "and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1228.52, "end": 1229.92, "text": "- Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1229.92, "end": 1232.92, "text": "As evil Jeff, am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.92, "end": 1233.76, "text": "Certainly."}, {"start": 1233.76, "end": 1234.92, "text": "I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.92, "end": 1236.68, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.68, "end": 1241.08, "text": "I lost my damn arm and you're making fake beards!"}, {"start": 1241.08, "end": 1241.92, "text": "Go tease."}, {"start": 1241.92, "end": 1244.42, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 1253.36, "end": 1255.76, "text": "Evil Troy and Evil, ah, bed!"}, {"start": 1255.76, "end": 1257.76, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 1259.92, "end": 1261.92, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1261.92, "end": 1263.92, "text": "- What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1263.92, "end": 1265.92, "text": "- More accurately. - I don't know."}, {"start": 1265.92, "end": 1267.92, "text": "- We got out just in space."}, {"start": 1267.92, "end": 1270.92, "text": "- Well, I certainly want right at the moment at night."}, {"start": 1270.92, "end": 1272.92, "text": "- I guess not then."}]}